      "title": "自适应量化终极算法2.0 （全新升级）",
      "content": "相对于（[1.0版本](https://www.joinquant.com/view/community/detail/0e16e4f33cb4e4d241bab8f0f2ca5f7e)）升级了\n\n- 用Dynamic Time Warping （DTW）代替简单的K-means， 以更好的适应时间序列数据， 并做了优化。\n\n- 全市场选股。\n\n算法思路参考 [《量化技术分析终极算法1.0 》](https://www.joinquant.com/view/community/detail/cbcd0bd305924e5124033ab60028e03a)\n\n\n参考\n\n- 1. [Time Series Classification and Clustering](https://nbviewer.org/github/alexminnaar/time-series-classification-and-clustering/blob/master/Time Series Classification and Clustering.ipynb)",
